            <ArticleTitle>An introduction to pain pathways and mechanisms.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>C188-91</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pain is a vital function of the nervous system in providing the body with a warning of potential or actual injury. It is both a sensory and emotional experience, affected by psychological factors such as past experiences, beliefs about pain, fear or anxiety.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
